WEBVTT

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.320
Cross, aren't you all?

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:36.340
No?

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.700
I guess we must be hungry.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.440
Bye-bye.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.060
Don't you say it?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.980
Cry for clamber and cry for milk.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:33.070
Oh!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:45.420
In and join the fun, get a drink if you ask for one

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:51.420
Give you some good advice, behave yourselves and we'll be nice

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:55.410
Would have shared our milk with you, only you
